# Generated test fixtures (DCS snapshots, converter outputs). GitHub folds all
# of them as generated. The multi-megabyte ones are also kept out of a default
# `git diff`, so a patch shows the code that changed: the GL-quote parity goldens
# and the rendered HtmlData snapshots. Their changes still show with
# `git diff --text`; the smaller fixtures (USFM, ResourceData, index.js) diff
# normally.
src/fixtures/** linguist-generated=true
src/fixtures/glquotes/** -diff
src/fixtures/*.htmlData.json -diff
